From f9e7d6d7018acb6faf0ed9c307491bc737105a42 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: baverrr <342259467+baverrr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 18:28:27 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Settings: Add the RavenOS glass theme

Draw Settings on a soft gradient backdrop with frosted, grouped cards,
inspired by the Apple Home app:

- Always use a dark base theme, with every color read from
  res/values/raven_glass.xml so a product overlay can recolor it.
- Use raven_backdrop as the window background, with transparent status,
  navigation and action bars.
- Add GlassGroupDecoration, which draws each preference group as one
  rounded card with inset separators, and centres the list in a column
  at most 760dp wide. Split the homepage into cards.
- Turn the search bar into a glass pill and the switch bar into a glass
  card that tints with the accent when on.
- Show the Personal/Work tabs as a segmented pill control.
- Keep dialogs on a solid surface, since Android 11 has no backdrop blur.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I1f4e427b54d16c7b87121a023d8f129708d27dee
